      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. Let me write the improved test with:\n1. Remove the ~15 unused imports and 5 unused fields copied from the full test class\n2. Remove confusing commented-out assertions and `TODO WIP` comment\n3. Split the two independent test cases into separate methods with descriptive names\n4. Add a clear comment explaining the lone-surrogate underflow behaviourThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes ~15 unused imports and 5 dead fields, eliminates the confusing commented-out `assertThrows` calls and `TODO WIP` note, extracts the lone-surrogate string into a named constant with an explanatory comment, and splits the two independent scenarios into separate test methods with descriptive names."
